# Gradio UI

- Consume existing pipeline outputs only. No AEO scoring, crawl, or optimization logic inside UI components.
- Keep honest section labels: ARTICLE · AI VISIBILITY (OBSERVED) · QUESTIONS (LLM-GENERATED) · OPPORTUNITIES · CURRENT vs RECOMMENDED · DIFF · SUMMARY.md · QUALITY EVALUATION.
- Prefer URL vs Markdown exclusivity and scrollable CURRENT/RECOMMENDED/DIFF panes when both exist.
- Never inject untrusted HTML into Gradio.
- UI acceptance requires the **user** to run Gradio locally and look. Agent text, tests, and chat summaries alone are not visual acceptance.
